<title>TAIWAN: Grand Petrochem stock plunges after blas.</title>
<headline>Grand Petrochem stock plunges after blas.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share price of Taiwan's Grand Petrochemical plunged on Monday following an explosion late Sunday at its Kaohsiung plant that caused a reported over T$200 million (US$7.16 million) in damage.</p>
<p>After one hour at 0200 GMT, Grand Petrochemical was down 6.10 percent or T$1.50 at T$23.10.</p>
<p>Grand Petrochemical said the explosion blew the tops off all six of the company's acrylonitrile-butadiene-styrene (ABS) powder storage tankers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (886-2-5080815)</p>
</text>
